        "id": 1135723
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-07T21:27:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1) Currently we dont have any equivalent API for onCapabilitiesChanged, am I right?\n2) If settings process is changing any capability, it will be in this flow\nsettings-\u003efrwks (ImsManager)-\u003evendor-\u003e Modem\nModem will update back the capabilities, if anything changed, coz of step 2\n\nAre you going to have 2 copies of Capabilities now? \nOne from apps and one from modem? Do we need it that way?\nWill there be a chance they are different? If yes, then am hoping it will only be different in transitional state and eventually, they both should stay the same. \n\nPlease correct, if my udnerstanding is wrong.",
      "parentUuid": "0995f75d_9fd4d070",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 27,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 27,
        "endChar": 36
